    "No old23 ADMITTED migration synthesis; ambiguous historical ACK remains unresolved.",
    "No generation/Run/effect invented; no budget settlement or UNKNOWN-to-confirmed promotion by cancellation.",
    "Dedicated23->24 release/migration/rollback path protects earlier SQL and queue/configuration contracts."
  ],
